<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: rgb(197,63,70); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 18px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">3  育人成效展现新面貌</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></ARTICLE></SECTION>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 15px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 43px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(123,12,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">规范心理、生涯、劳动和综合实践活动课程，通过“一单一册一社团三系列”，把牢“立德树人”根本任务，践行社会主义核心价值观，引导学生德智体美劳全面发展和个性特长特色成长。创建博雅大讲堂、爸妈课堂，着力构建“360°环绕式”生涯教育体系，全年共有北大、清华等“双一流”高校院所16位院士、教授，6位专家型家长进校为学生开展讲座。围绕“培元、通达、博雅”三个主题，进一步构建系列德育课程、系列德育品质、系列德育价值，全面提升学校德育工作实效。制定劳动教育实施方案和课程规划，拓展劳动教育渠道，利用绍兴本地资源，组织全校学生到浙江军旅文化园、米果果小镇、黄酒小镇开展综合实践活动。学校《</SPAN><STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(123,12,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">汲取校史资源，融创立人路径</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(123,12,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">》德育课程方案获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">2020年绍兴市中小学德育微创新实践成果一等奖</STRONG>，学校获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">绍兴市德育工作先进集体</STRONG>。学生在全国中学生模拟两会、第七届全国青少年模拟政协、市首届生涯规划大赛等活动中均获佳绩，近<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">20</STRONG>位教师荣获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">德育类个人荣誉</STRONG>。</SPAN></P>
