<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 15px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 43px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(123,12,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">顺利完成中层选聘调整，“80后”干部达到15%及以上，“85后”干部达到10%及以上。按照“内培、优引、劣汰、特招、外聘、专留”12字方针，制定《绍兴市第一中学教师专业发展与师资队伍建设行动方案》，落实《职初教师成长工作坊实施方案》《骨干教师“提升计划”实施方案》《名优教师攀登计划实施方案》《卓越教师领军计划实施方案》四个工程，制定《教师个人三年发展规划》，量身定制教师个体成长方案，为教师发展提供支持。利用政府引才政策，面向全国引进<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">特级正高教师3人</STRONG>、<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">省级以上荣誉骨干教师2人</STRONG>，优化名师结构。借力选修课程教师聘用政策，外聘日语教师开设选修课程，与北大联合成立“<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">绍兴一中北大名师工作室</STRONG>”，北大五大竞赛、地理天文学科顶尖专家引领学校各学科竞赛团队为学生开设选修课程。利用学校自主评聘试点改革契机，新聘中高级教师15人，小岗晋级60人，劝退教师2人，高职低聘1人。<SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(123,12,0); FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 43px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial">学校推优教师获省市名师、学科带头人等专业荣誉教师8人次。</SPAN>在市直学校基本功大比武中，11门学科8门成绩平均<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">分列第一</STRONG>；在各级优质课评比中，赵正瑜老师获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">省一等奖</STRONG>，3位老师获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">市级一等奖</STRONG>，9位老师获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">市直一等奖。</STRONG></SPAN></P></SPAN>
