<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: rgb(197,63,70); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 18px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">6  学生自治展示新风采</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></ARTICLE></SECTION>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 15px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 43px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(123,12,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">实施“<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">学生校长助理</STRONG>”聘任管理制度，举行“我与校长面对面”学生干部座谈会4次，落实党组织书记到“学生课余党校”上党课6次，面向尖子生创办“<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">博雅人才学院</STRONG>”，强化党的教育和引导。学校被授予<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">第一批市直学校唯一“绍兴市共青团组织力提升示范点”</STRONG>。在年初疫情防控的关键时期，学校团委学生自发组织抗疫募捐，以“绍兴一中学子”名义向中华慈善总会“战胜新型冠状病毒感染的肺炎疫情”专门项目捐款<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">86888.66</STRONG>元，活动受到团浙江省委《浙江青年动态》报道。在2020年全国青少年模拟两会的舞台上，一中学子完成并提交<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">高质量会议提案《关于完善单用途预付卡管理的提案》</STRONG>，获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">全国“最佳提案/建议奖”，并提交至全国两会</STRONG>。此外，一中学子代表经过层层选拔组成绍兴一中代表团，赴京参加<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">中央电视台CCTV14频道《SK极智少年强》</STRONG>节目2020年春季赛，获<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">全国季军</STRONG>。</SPAN></P></SPAN>
