<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-WEIGHT: 700; COLOR: rgb(197,63,70); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 18px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: 2px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">8  服务保障智治拓新局</SPAN></P></SECTION></SECTION></ARTICLE></SECTION>
<P style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 15px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Helvetica Neue', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei UI', 'Microsoft YaHei', Arial, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: left; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; CLEAR: both; MARGIN: 0px; MIN-HEIGHT: 1em; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 43px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word"><SPAN style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; FONT-SIZE: 16px; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(123,12,0); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">学校总务后勤部门为优化师生服务保障，多措并举，保安全，优功能，强管控，实现总体工作拓面创新。一是探索实施<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">校园网格化长效管控机制</STRONG>，创造性建设并实施“<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">校内校外两张网和智能化一平台</STRONG>”网格化管理模式，实现学校智能化管理“横到边、竖到底、纵到家”全域平安目标，杜绝校园安全事故，为保障校园防疫安全发挥了关键性作用。二是<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">优化校园节电改造</STRONG>，对校园整个电能供应系统实施过程管理和运行监控，提高供能保障系统的管理水平，优化能源供应与节约，杜绝用电安全隐患。三是<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">试点创新食品安全智能监管</STRONG>。我校作为<STRONG style="BOX-SIZING: border-box !important; MAX-WIDTH: 100%; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word">绍兴市校园食品安全云守护平台首家试点单位</STRONG>，创新应用AI技术，引入物联网技术实现对食堂的精准管控，让后厨违规行为可识别、可抓拍、可示警，切实把好校园食品安全关，为“智慧校园”建设拓展新局面。</SPAN></P>
